cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use basicDraCor, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "basicDraCor"
abstract: >-
  basicDraCor is a wrapper for the DraCor API (https://dracor.org/api/v1)
  written in BASIC (QB64 Phoenix Edition). It provides functions for corpora,
  plays, metrics, characters and spoken text, and resolves DraCor play IDs.
authors:
